<main role="main" id="main-content">
	<div class="page-header">
	<h1>The power of good design</h1>
			<div class="intro-text"><span>Dieter Rams’s ideology, engrained within Vitsœ</span>
				</div>
	</div>
	<div id="content" class="cf">
		

<div class="container">

		<div class="introductions borderless margin-below-2">

			<div class="introductions-title">
				
					<h2 data-anchor="anchor">Good design at Vitsœ<span class="hidden">Good design at Vitsœ</span></h2>
				
			</div>
			<div class="introductions-media">
				<figure>
					<img sizes="(min-width: 1060px) and (-webkit-min-device-pixel-ratio: 1.9) 2100px, (min-width: 1060px) and (min-resolution: 1.9) 2100px, (min-width: 2120px) 2100px, (min-width: 1060px) 1050px, 100vw" srcset="https://d2lsod3xpjaepj.cloudfront.net/files/assets/2000/1704/crop169/50.jpg 50w, https://d2lsod3xpjaepj.cloudfront.net/files/assets/2000/1704/crop169/170.jpg 170w, https://d2lsod3xpjaepj.cloudfront.net/files/assets/2000/1704/crop169/410.jpg 410w, https://d2lsod3xpjaepj.cloudfront.net/files/assets/2000/1704/crop169/710.jpg 710w, https://d2lsod3xpjaepj.cloudfront.net/files/assets/2000/1704/crop169/1050.jpg 1050w, https://d2lsod3xpjaepj.cloudfront.net/files/assets/2000/1704/crop169/1920.jpg 1920w, https://d2lsod3xpjaepj.cloudfront.net/files/assets/2000/1704/crop169/2880.jpg 2880w" src="https://d2lsod3xpjaepj.cloudfront.net/files/assets/2000/1704/crop169/1050.jpg" alt="620 Chair high back in red leather with off-white shell. 606 Universal Shelving System in the background." />
					<figcaption></figcaption>
				</figure>
			</div>
			<div class="introductions-content">
				<p>Here at Vitsœ we stand for the inordinate power of good design in everything we do: designing thoughtfully, responsibly and intelligently for our company, our furniture and the many people who share a profound interest in all of our tomorrows.</p>

<p>For over 65 years, Vitsœ has worked continuously with Dieter Rams. He still improves his designs to this day and is often cited by a new generation as a key influence on their work that is shaping the 21st century.</p>

			</div>
		</div>

		<div class="quote margin-below" >
			<div class="quote-content">
				<div class="quote-text"><p>“In 1957 I began to develop a storage system that formed the basis of the company Vitsœ, which was founded in 1959. Thus the ideology behind my design is engrained within the company.”</p>
</div>
				<div class="quote-author">
					<div class="quote-author-title">Dieter Rams</div>
				</div>
			</div>
		</div>

		<div class="text-block border-below-none padding-above" style="padding-top: 24px;">
			<div class="text-block-title">
				<h2 data-anchor="anchor">Ten principles for good design<span class="hidden">Ten principles for good design</span></h2>
			</div>
			<div class="text-block-content margin-below">
				<p>Back in the late 1970s, Dieter Rams was becoming increasingly concerned by the state of the world around him: “An impenetrable confusion of forms, colours and noises.”</p>

<p>Aware that he was a significant contributor to that world, he asked himself an important question: is my design good design?</p>

<p>His answer is expressed in his ten principles for good design.</p>

			</div>
			<figure class="text-block-primary-image">
				<img sizes="(min-width: 1060px) and (-webkit-min-device-pixel-ratio: 1.9) 1420px, (min-width: 1060px) and (min-resolution: 1.9) 1420px, (min-width: 2120px) 1420px, (min-width: 1060px) 710px, 100vw" srcset="https://d2lsod3xpjaepj.cloudfront.net/files/assets/2000/1328/crop169/50.jpg 50w, https://d2lsod3xpjaepj.cloudfront.net/files/assets/2000/1328/crop169/170.jpg 170w, https://d2lsod3xpjaepj.cloudfront.net/files/assets/2000/1328/crop169/410.jpg 410w, https://d2lsod3xpjaepj.cloudfront.net/files/assets/2000/1328/crop169/710.jpg 710w, https://d2lsod3xpjaepj.cloudfront.net/files/assets/2000/1328/crop169/1050.jpg 1050w, https://d2lsod3xpjaepj.cloudfront.net/files/assets/2000/1328/crop169/1050.jpg 1920w, https://d2lsod3xpjaepj.cloudfront.net/files/assets/2000/1328/crop169/1050.jpg 2880w" src="https://d2lsod3xpjaepj.cloudfront.net/files/assets/2000/1328/crop169/710.jpg" alt="Dieter Rams, Vitsœ&#039;s furniture designer. Photograph by Abisag Tüllmann" />
				<figcaption>
					Vitsœ’s designer, Dieter Rams. Photograph by Abisag Tüllmann
					
				</figcaption>
			</figure>
		</div>

		<div class="border-above principle">
			<div class="principle-number extra-indent">1</div>
			<div class="principle-content">
				<h2 data-anchor="anchor">Good design is innovative<span class="hidden">Good design is innovative</span></h2>
				<p>The possibilities for innovation are not, by any means, exhausted. Technological development is always offering new opportunities for innovative design. But innovative design always develops in tandem with innovative technology, and can never be an end in itself.</p>

				
			</div>
			<figure class="principle-image">
				<img sizes="(min-width: 1060px) and (-webkit-min-device-pixel-ratio: 1.9) 820px, (min-width: 1060px) and (min-resolution: 1.9) 820px, (min-width: 2120px) 820px, (min-width: 1060px) 410px, 100vw" srcset="https://d2lsod3xpjaepj.cloudfront.net/files/assets/1000/139/crops/50.jpg 50w, https://d2lsod3xpjaepj.cloudfront.net/files/assets/1000/139/crops/170.jpg 170w, https://d2lsod3xpjaepj.cloudfront.net/files/assets/1000/139/crops/410.jpg 410w, https://d2lsod3xpjaepj.cloudfront.net/files/assets/1000/139/crops/710.jpg 710w, https://d2lsod3xpjaepj.cloudfront.net/files/assets/1000/139/crops/710.jpg 1050w, https://d2lsod3xpjaepj.cloudfront.net/files/assets/1000/139/crops/710.jpg 1920w, https://d2lsod3xpjaepj.cloudfront.net/files/assets/1000/139/crops/710.jpg 2880w" src="https://d2lsod3xpjaepj.cloudfront.net/files/assets/1000/139/crops/410.jpg" alt="Braun TP 1 radio/phono designed by Dieter Rams" />
				<figcaption>TP 1 radio/phono combination, 1959, by Dieter Rams for Braun</figcaption>
			</figure>
		</div>

		<div class="principle">
			<div class="principle-number">2</div>
			<div class="principle-content">
				<h2 data-anchor="anchor">Good design makes a product useful<span class="hidden">Good design makes a product useful</span></h2>
				<p>A product is bought to be used. It has to satisfy certain criteria, not only functional, but also psychological and aesthetic. Good design emphasizes the usefulness of a product whilst disregarding anything that could possibly detract from it.</p>

				
			</div>
			<figure class="principle-image">
				<img sizes="(min-width: 1060px) and (-webkit-min-device-pixel-ratio: 1.9) 820px, (min-width: 1060px) and (min-resolution: 1.9) 820px, (min-width: 2120px) 820px, (min-width: 1060px) 410px, 100vw" srcset="https://d2lsod3xpjaepj.cloudfront.net/files/assets/1000/140/crops/50.jpg 50w, https://d2lsod3xpjaepj.cloudfront.net/files/assets/1000/140/crops/170.jpg 170w, https://d2lsod3xpjaepj.cloudfront.net/files/assets/1000/140/crops/410.jpg 410w, https://d2lsod3xpjaepj.cloudfront.net/files/assets/1000/140/crops/710.jpg 710w, https://d2lsod3xpjaepj.cloudfront.net/files/assets/1000/140/crops/710.jpg 1050w, https://d2lsod3xpjaepj.cloudfront.net/files/assets/1000/140/crops/710.jpg 1920w, https://d2lsod3xpjaepj.cloudfront.net/files/assets/1000/140/crops/710.jpg 2880w" src="https://d2lsod3xpjaepj.cloudfront.net/files/assets/1000/140/crops/410.jpg" alt="Braun MPZ 21 multipress citrus juicer designed by Dieter Rams" />
				<figcaption>MPZ 21 multipress citrus juicer, 1972, by Dieter Rams and Jürgen Greubel for Braun</figcaption>
			</figure>
		</div>

		<div class="principle">
			<div class="principle-number">3</div>
			<div class="principle-content">
				<h2 data-anchor="anchor">Good design is aesthetic<span class="hidden">Good design is aesthetic</span></h2>
				<p>The aesthetic quality of a product is integral to its usefulness because products we use every day affect our person and our well-being. But only well-executed objects can be beautiful.</p>

				
			</div>
			<figure class="principle-image">
				<img sizes="(min-width: 1060px) and (-webkit-min-device-pixel-ratio: 1.9) 820px, (min-width: 1060px) and (min-resolution: 1.9) 820px, (min-width: 2120px) 820px, (min-width: 1060px) 410px, 100vw" srcset="https://d2lsod3xpjaepj.cloudfront.net/files/assets/1000/141/crops/50.jpg 50w, https://d2lsod3xpjaepj.cloudfront.net/files/assets/1000/141/crops/170.jpg 170w, https://d2lsod3xpjaepj.cloudfront.net/files/assets/1000/141/crops/410.jpg 410w, https://d2lsod3xpjaepj.cloudfront.net/files/assets/1000/141/crops/710.jpg 710w, https://d2lsod3xpjaepj.cloudfront.net/files/assets/1000/141/crops/710.jpg 1050w, https://d2lsod3xpjaepj.cloudfront.net/files/assets/1000/141/crops/710.jpg 1920w, https://d2lsod3xpjaepj.cloudfront.net/files/assets/1000/141/crops/710.jpg 2880w" src="https://d2lsod3xpjaepj.cloudfront.net/files/assets/1000/141/crops/410.jpg" alt="Braun RT 20 tisch super radio, designed by Dieter Rams" />
				<figcaption>RT 20 tischsuper radio, 1961, by Dieter Rams for Braun</figcaption>
			</figure>
		</div>

		<div class="principle">
			<div class="principle-number">4</div>
			<div class="principle-content">
				<h2 data-anchor="anchor">Good design makes a product understandable<span class="hidden">Good design makes a product understandable</span></h2>
				<p>It clarifies the product’s structure. Better still, it can make the product talk. At best, it is self-explanatory.</p>

				
			</div>
			<figure class="principle-image">
				<img sizes="(min-width: 1060px) and (-webkit-min-device-pixel-ratio: 1.9) 820px, (min-width: 1060px) and (min-resolution: 1.9) 820px, (min-width: 2120px) 820px, (min-width: 1060px) 410px, 100vw" srcset="https://d2lsod3xpjaepj.cloudfront.net/files/assets/1000/142/crops/50.jpg 50w, https://d2lsod3xpjaepj.cloudfront.net/files/assets/1000/142/crops/170.jpg 170w, https://d2lsod3xpjaepj.cloudfront.net/files/assets/1000/142/crops/410.jpg 410w, https://d2lsod3xpjaepj.cloudfront.net/files/assets/1000/142/crops/710.jpg 710w, https://d2lsod3xpjaepj.cloudfront.net/files/assets/1000/142/crops/710.jpg 1050w, https://d2lsod3xpjaepj.cloudfront.net/files/assets/1000/142/crops/710.jpg 1920w, https://d2lsod3xpjaepj.cloudfront.net/files/assets/1000/142/crops/710.jpg 2880w" src="https://d2lsod3xpjaepj.cloudfront.net/files/assets/1000/142/crops/410.jpg" alt="Braun T 1000 world receiver, designed by Dieter Rams" />
				<figcaption>T 1000 world receiver, 1963, by Dieter Rams for Braun</figcaption>
			</figure>
		</div>

		<div class="principle">
			<div class="principle-number">5</div>
			<div class="principle-content">
				<h2 data-anchor="anchor">Good design is unobtrusive<span class="hidden">Good design is unobtrusive</span></h2>
				<p>Products fulfilling a purpose are like tools. They are neither decorative objects nor works of art. Their design should therefore be both neutral and restrained, to leave room for the user’s self-expression.</p>

				
			</div>
